.PP
Initializes an unsigned 128 bit integer to a given value\&. 
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIa\fP A pointer to the sc_uint128_t that will be initialized\&. 
.br
\fIhigh\fP The given high bits to initialize \fIa\fP\&. 
